{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "weather.wttr",
  "version": 9,
  "name": "查天气",
  "summary": "使用 wttr.in 查询单城或自选城市天气；支持管理自选城市与默认城市，默认轻量 j2，详细预报使用 j1。",
  "routeHint": [
    "用户想查某地天气 / 预报时",
    "用户想管理自选城市时",
    "用户想设默认城市时"
  ],
  "primitives": [],
  "prompt": "用户明确想查询天气、管理自选城市或默认城市时才使用本技能；只是讨论天气、气候或气象知识时正常回答。所有数据操作和天气取数都通过 run_workflow 完成，不直接调用 kv_read / kv_write，也不自行访问网络。\\n\\n【工作流操作】只使用五种 operation：storageGet、storageSet、storageDelete、weatherBatch、weatherWatchlist。存储固定使用 prefs/weather.watchlist（字符串数组）与 prefs/weather.defaultCity（城市名称字符串），不要使用其他域或键。读取时 storageGet 传 key；写入时 storageSet 传 key、valueKey，并把实际值放在对应输入（valueKey=watchlist 时传 watchlist 数组；valueKey=defaultCity 时传 defaultCity 字符串）；删除时 storageDelete 传 key。\\n\\n【自选城市】查看时读取 weather.watchlist；返回 null 或空数组时告知尚未添加，否则按实际列表展示。添加或删除前先读取列表：添加只在不存在时追加；删除只移除用户点名的城市；再用 storageSet 写回完整字符串数组（key=weather.watchlist，valueKey=watchlist）。保存失败必须如实说明。添加自选不自动查询天气。\\n\\n【默认城市】读取 weather.defaultCity；设置时用 storageSet（key=weather.defaultCity，valueKey=defaultCity）；清除时用 storageDelete（key=weather.defaultCity）。用户明确指定城市时优先查询该城市，不被默认城市覆盖。用户未指定城市时先读取默认城市；没有默认城市则询问用户，不擅自选择城市。\\n\\n【天气查询】查询用户明确点名的城市或批量指定城市时用 weatherBatch；查询「我的自选城市天气 / 自选城市列表天气」时用 weatherWatchlist，**不传 cities**，宿主会自动读取 prefs/weather.watchlist 作为城市列表（这种查询不显示加入自选链接，因为那些城市已在自选里）。两种操作 cities 都传城市名称字符串数组，每项就是一个城市名（中文、拼音、英文均可，直接作为 wttr.in 的查询词），例如 [ '深圳', '北京' ]；单城市就传只含一项的数组，批量按原列表顺序。不要把城市包成对象，也不要另造 slug 或 city 字段。每个城市独立请求，某个城市失败不影响其他城市。默认 format=j2；用户明确要求未来几天、明天后天、逐时或详细预报时用 j1。工作流只把 current_condition[0] 与 weather 预报字段交给模型，不把完整响应带入上下文。\\n\\n【准确性与输出】只根据工作流返回的实际字段播报：当前天气、气温、体感温度、湿度、风速、当天最高/最低气温；只有 j1 返回 hourly 时才补充逐时趋势。缺字段、请求失败或 JSON 异常时如实说明，不编造。批量查询按城市分别说明成功或失败。标注数据来自 wttr.in。\\n\\n\\n\\n【加入自选链接】weatherBatch 取数成功后，宿主会在结果下方自动展示每个城市的「加入自选城市」链接（prefs-add 协议，由工作流 display 节点产出、走数据旁路，不进模型上下文）；你不需要、也不应该在回复正文里自己写任何链接。weatherWatchlist（查自选列表天气）不显示该链接。用户点击链接或明确说加入/删除自选时，按【自选城市】段用 storageGet / storageSet 读写 weather.watchlist 并回执。",
  "category": "生活",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "name": "operation",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "enum": [
        "storageGet",
        "storageSet",
        "storageDelete",
        "weatherBatch",
        "weatherWatchlist"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "key",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "name": "valueKey",
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "watchlist",
        "defaultCity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "watchlist",
      "type": "array",
      "default": []
    },
    {
      "name": "defaultCity",
      "type": "string",
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "cities",
      "type": "array"
    },
    {
      "name": "format",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "j2",
      "enum": [
        "j2",
        "j1"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "workflow": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "dispatch_flag_0",
        "call": "json.get",
        "args": {
          "value": {
            "storageGet": true,
            "storageSet": false,
            "storageDelete": false,
            "weatherBatch": false,
            "weatherWatchlist": false
          },
          "path": "{{input.operation}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "dispatch_0",
        "ifElse": {
          "condition": {
            "from": "dispatch_flag_0",
            "path": "$"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "id": "storage_get",
              "call": "storage.get",
              "args": {
                "domain": "prefs",
                "key": "{{input.key}}"
              },
              "yield": true
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "id": "dispatch_flag_1",
              "call": "json.get",
              "args": {
                "value": {
                  "storageGet": false,
                  "storageSet": true,
                  "storageDelete": false,
                  "weatherBatch": false,
                  "weatherWatchlist": false
                },
                "path": "{{input.operation}}"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "dispatch_1",
              "ifElse": {
                "condition": {
                  "from": "dispatch_flag_1",
                  "path": "$"
                },
                "then": [
                  {
                    "id": "storage_value",
                    "call": "json.get",
                    "args": {
                      "value": {
                        "watchlist": "{{input.watchlist}}",
                        "defaultCity": "{{input.defaultCity}}"
                      },
                      "path": "{{input.valueKey}}"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "storage_set",
                    "call": "storage.set",
                    "args": {
                      "domain": "prefs",
                      "key": "{{input.key}}"
                    },
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "storage_value",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "value"
                      }
                    ],
                    "yield": true
                  }
                ],
                "else": [
                  {
                    "id": "dispatch_flag_2",
                    "call": "json.get",
                    "args": {
                      "value": {
                        "storageGet": false,
                        "storageSet": false,
                        "storageDelete": true,
                        "weatherBatch": false,
                        "weatherWatchlist": false
                      },
                      "path": "{{input.operation}}"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "dispatch_2",
                    "ifElse": {
                      "condition": {
                        "from": "dispatch_flag_2",
                        "path": "$"
                      },
                      "then": [
                        {
                          "id": "storage_delete",
                          "call": "storage.delete",
                          "args": {
                            "domain": "prefs",
                            "key": "{{input.key}}"
                          },
                          "yield": true
                        }
                      ],
                      "else": [
                        {
                          "id": "dispatch_flag_3",
                          "call": "json.get",
                          "args": {
                            "value": {
                              "storageGet": false,
                              "storageSet": false,
                              "storageDelete": false,
                              "weatherBatch": true,
                              "weatherWatchlist": true
                            },
                            "path": "{{input.operation}}"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "dispatch_3",
                          "ifElse": {
                            "condition": {
                              "from": "dispatch_flag_3",
                              "path": "$"
                            },
                            "then": [
                              {
                                "id": "show_link_flag",
                                "call": "json.get",
                                "args": {
                                  "value": {
                                    "weatherBatch": true,
                                    "weatherWatchlist": false
                                  },
                                  "path": "{{input.operation}}"
                                }
                              },
                              {
                                "id": "city_source",
                                "ifElse": {
                                  "condition": {
                                    "from": "show_link_flag",
                                    "path": "$"
                                  },
                                  "then": [
                                    {
                                      "id": "from_input",
                                      "call": "json.get",
                                      "args": {
                                        "value": {
                                          "cities": "{{input.cities}}"
                                        },
                                        "path": "cities"
                                      }
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "else": [
                                    {
                                      "id": "watchlist_get",
                                      "call": "storage.get",
                                      "args": {
                                        "domain": "prefs",
                                        "key": "weather.watchlist"
                                      }
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "id": "from_watchlist",
                                      "call": "json.concat",
                                      "args": {
                                        "right": []
                                      },
                                      "bindings": [
                                        {
                                          "from": "watchlist_get",
                                          "path": "$",
                                          "as": "left"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              },
                              {
                                "id": "city_items",
                                "call": "json.concat",
                                "args": {
                                  "right": []
                                },
                                "bindings": [
                                  {
                                    "from": "city_source",
                                    "path": "value",
                                    "as": "left"
                                  }
                                ]
                              },
                              {
                                "id": "batch_loop",
                                "forEach": {
                                  "from": "city_items",
                                  "path": "$",
                                  "onError": "continue",
                                  "steps": [
                                    {
                                      "id": "batch_fetch",
                                      "call": "web_fetch",
                                      "args": {
                                        "url": "https://wttr.in/{{urlencode.item}}?format={{input.format}}",
                                        "storeOnly": true
                                      }
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "id": "batch_current",
                                      "call": "json.get",
                                      "args": {
                                        "path": "current_condition[0]"
                                      },
                                      "bindings": [
                                        {
                                          "from": "batch_fetch",
                                          "path": "$",
                                          "as": "value"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "id": "batch_forecast",
                                      "call": "json.get",
                                      "args": {
                                        "path": "weather"
                                      },
                                      "bindings": [
                                        {
                                          "from": "batch_fetch",
                                          "path": "$",
                                          "as": "value"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "id": "batch_base",
                                      "call": "json.set",
                                      "args": {
                                        "value": {},
                                        "path": "city",
                                        "nextValue": "{{item}}"
                                      }
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "id": "batch_with_current",
                                      "call": "json.set",
                                      "args": {
                                        "path": "current"
                                      },
                                      "bindings": [
                                        {
                                          "from": "batch_base",
                                          "path": "$",
                                          "as": "value"
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "from": "batch_current",
                                          "path": "$",
                                          "as": "nextValue"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "id": "batch_summary",
                                      "call": "json.set",
                                      "args": {
                                        "path": "forecast"
                                      },
                                      "bindings": [
                                        {
                                          "from": "batch_with_current",
                                          "path": "$",
                                          "as": "value"
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "from": "batch_forecast",
                                          "path": "$",
                                          "as": "nextValue"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                "yield": true
                              },
                              {
                                "id": "maybe_links",
                                "ifElse": {
                                  "condition": {
                                    "from": "show_link_flag",
                                    "path": "$"
                                  },
                                  "then": [
                                    {
                                      "id": "links_loop",
                                      "forEach": {
                                        "from": "city_items",
                                        "path": "$",
                                        "onError": "continue",
                                        "steps": [
                                          {
                                            "id": "add_city_link",
                                            "call": "display",
                                            "args": {
                                              "format": "markdown",
                                              "value": "[加入自选城市：{{item}}](prefs-add:prefs:weather.watchlist:{{item}})"
                                            }
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "else": []
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "returnToLLM": true
}
